WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.573
Tina: How will we know when we find an ant trail?

2
00:00:14.574 --> 00:00:16.692
Brad: It won't be that hard.

3
00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:21.134
Brad: Ants have six legs, so there will be lots of footprints.

4
00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:26.907
Tina: What else?

5
00:00:26.908 --> 00:00:30.304
Brad: An ant can pull fifty times its own body weight.

6
00:00:30.305 --> 00:00:33.798
Brad: So there may be marks from ants dragging things.

7
00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:36.812
Brad: And remember, we're really small.

8
00:00:36.813 --> 00:00:39.918
Brad: So an ant trail will be pretty big.

9
00:00:39.919 --> 00:00:43.118
It might be as big as a road.

10
00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:50.393
Tina: I hope Danny and Bello are having better luck than us.

11
00:00:50.394 --> 00:00:52.927
Danny: Bello, this is great.

12
00:00:52.928 --> 00:00:55.086
Bello: What do you mean, Danny?

13
00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:57.946
Danny: It's fun having an adventure with you!

14
00:00:57.947 --> 00:01:01.436
Danny: I thought I would never see you again.

15
00:01:01.437 --> 00:01:03.874
Bello: I'm happy to see you too.

16
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:07.668
Bello: But I don't think the boys you shrunk are having a good time.

17
00:01:07.669 --> 00:01:09.555
Danny: You're probably right.

18
00:01:09.556 --> 00:01:11.498
Bello: I'm worried about them.

19
00:01:11.499 --> 00:01:15.017
Being a prisoner is horrible.

20
00:01:15.018 --> 00:01:17.640
Danny: I didn't mean for this to happen.

21
00:01:17.641 --> 00:01:20.940
Danny: Brad and I really were planning to unshrink them.

22
00:01:20.941 --> 00:01:23.956
Danny: We didn't know they would get captured.

23
00:01:23.957 --> 00:01:28.927
Bello: I'm sure you didn't, but it's a terrible situation.

24
00:01:28.928 --> 00:01:33.723
Danny: Don't worry. Everything will be all right after we rescue them.

25
00:01:33.724 --> 00:01:39.898
Danny: It's going to be a great adventure!

26
00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.352
Danny: Look, ant prints!

27
00:01:42.353 --> 00:01:44.122
Bello: And lots of them.

28
00:01:44.123 --> 00:01:47.040
Danny: I told you everything would be all right.

29
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:48.630
Bello: You stay here.

30
00:01:48.631 --> 00:01:54.545
I'll go get Tina and Brad.

31
00:01:54.546 --> 00:02:05.542
Danny: I wonder which way the ants went.

32
00:02:05.543 --> 00:02:07.408
Ant 1: Did you hear the news?

33
00:02:07.409 --> 00:02:09.251
Ant 2: No, what news?

34
00:02:09.252 --> 00:02:14.301
Ant 1: It's too amazing to be true.

35
00:02:14.302 --> 00:02:16.718
Danny: Shh. Listen.

36
00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:19.822
Ant 1: There is going to be a new exhibit in the zoo.

37
00:02:19.823 --> 00:02:20.933
Ant 2: Really?

38
00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:26.391
Ant 1: Yes. It's a new creature never captured before.

39
00:02:26.392 --> 00:02:29.692
Ant 1: They bought the creatures from the mites.

40
00:02:29.693 --> 00:02:32.855
Tina: Do you think they were talking about the bullies?

41
00:02:32.856 --> 00:02:35.482
Danny: We have to follow them.

42
00:02:35.483 --> 00:02:45.105
Brad: Quickly, before they get too far ahead.

43
00:02:45.106 --> 00:02:47.589
Tina: They went down that hole.

44
00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.441
Brad: Are we going to follow?

45
00:02:49.442 --> 00:02:51.521
It looks dangerous.

46
00:02:51.522 --> 00:02:54.256
Danny: This is no time to be scared, Brad.

47
00:02:54.257 --> 00:03:00.765
We're on a rescue mission!

48
00:03:00.766 --> 00:03:02.905
Tina: What did you say to Danny?

49
00:03:02.906 --> 00:03:05.415
He has a positive attitude.

50
00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:08.918
Bello: He's just happy to be having an adventure.

51
00:03:08.919 --> 00:03:12.170
Tina: Well, I like having an adventure too.

52
00:03:12.171 --> 00:03:17.549
Bello: Me too. Let's go.
